      <h1 id="persistent-storage-using-flexvolume" class="group scroll-mt-20">Persistent storage using FlexVolume<a href="#persistent-storage-using-flexvolume" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
      <p class="_abstract">To use storage from a back-end that does not have a built-in plugin, you can extend OpenShift Container Platform through FlexVolume drivers and provide persistent storage to applications.</p>
