      <p class="_abstract">You can implement FlexVolumes by using a list of operations to call and the installation path are all that is required. FlexVolume drivers that are used to extend OpenShift Container Platform are executed only on the node. </p>
      <p><strong>Prerequisites</strong></p>
      <ul><li>FlexVolume drivers must implement these operations:</li></ul>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>init</code></dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Initializes the driver. It is called during initialization of all nodes.</p></dd>
