      <li>Executed on: node</li>
      <li>Expected output: default JSON</li>
      </ul>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>mountdevice</code></dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Mounts a volume’s device to a directory where individual pods can then bind mount. This call-out does not pass "secrets" specified in the FlexVolume spec. If your driver requires secrets, do not implement this call-out.</p></dd>
